[248.12381, "o", "\u001b[68C\u001b[1K\r\n**2. `packages/api/src/components/pay/PaymentService.ts`**\u001b[11X\r\nA class that posts tokenized payment requests to the backend:\u001b[8X\r\n- `submit(request: PaymentRequest): Promise<PaymentResult>` — POSTs t\u001b[5;69H\u001b[1K\ro configured endpoint\r\n- Internal `fetchWithRetry` — retries up to `maxRetries` times on net\r\nwork errors / 5xx, never on 4xx (card declined, etc.)\u001b[16X\r\n- `AbortController`-based timeout per attempt\u001b[24X\r\n- **PCI-DSS**: raw card fields never enter this class — it only ever \r\nsees the opaque `token` from the processor SDK\u001b[23X\r\n- TypeScript strict mode throughout\u001b[34X\u001b[12;69H\u001b[1K\r\n**3. `packages/api/tests/unit/PaymentService.test.ts`**\u001b[14X\r\nPlaced in `tests/unit/` (picked up by the existing `vitest.config.ts`\u001b[15;69H\u001b[1K\r node environment):\r\n- Success path: POST receives 200, returns `PaymentResult`\u001b[11X\r\n- Network error: retries up to `maxRetries`, then throws `PaymentServ\u001b[18;69H\u001b[1K\riceError` with `retryable: true`\r\n- 4xx (card declined): does NOT retry, throws `PaymentServiceError` w\u001b[20;69H\u001b[1K\rith `retryable: false`\r\n- 5xx server error: retries, then throws\u001b[29X\r\n- Timeout: AbortController fires, retries, then throws\u001b[15X\r\n- Idempotency key is forwarded in the request header\u001b[17X\u001b[H"]
[250.490965, "o", "A class that posts tokenized payment requests to the backend:\u001b[8X\r\n- `submit(request: PaymentRequest): Promise<PaymentResult>` — POSTs t\u001b[3;69H\u001b[1K\ro configured endpoint\r\n- Internal `fetchWithRetry` — retries up to `maxRetries` times on net\r\nwork errors / 5xx, never on 4xx (card declined, etc.)\u001b[16X\r\n- `AbortController`-based timeout per attempt\u001b[24X\r\n- **PCI-DSS**: raw card fields never enter this class — it only ever \r\nsees the opaque `token` from the processor SDK\u001b[23X\r\n- TypeScript strict mode throughout\u001b[34X\u001b[10;69H\u001b[1K\r\n**3. `packages/api/tests/unit/PaymentService.test.ts`**\u001b[14X\r\nPlaced in `tests/unit/` (picked up by the existing `vitest.config.ts`\u001b[13;69H\u001b[1K\r node environment):\r\n- Success path: POST receives 200, returns `PaymentResult`\u001b[11X\r\n- Network error: retries up to `maxRetries`, then throws `PaymentServ\u001b[16;69H\u001b[1K\riceError` with `retryable: true`\r\n- 4xx (card declined): does NOT retry, throws `PaymentServiceError` w\u001b[18;69H\u001b[1K\rith `retryable: false`\r\n- 5xx server error: retries, then throws\u001b[29X\r\n- Timeout: AbortController fires, retries, then throws\u001b[15X\r\n- Idempotency key is forwarded in the request header\u001b[17X\r\n- Verifies no raw card fields are accepted in the type signature (com\r\npile-time safety demonstrated in test)\u001b[31X\u001b[H"]
